WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.850
Crouching light punches begin the close confirm.

2
00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:02.250
Standing light kick completes the three-light starter.

3
00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:03.250
Light Tatsu launches the standing opponent.

4
00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:06.700
Akuma activates Level 2 beneath the airborne opponent.

5
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:08.600
The Level 2 sequence carries Ryu away.

6
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:09.650
Ryu lands after the Super finish.
